data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":1298,"item_id":"msg_0eb185ebef4b0d14016b0a782a77cc87d1afe63821436154bb","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"kai\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The related capabilities have been checked. bounded-resource-search-recheck already supports empty-source rechecking and bypasses the low-satiety stop, but its emergency mode still stops at health <=60; minHealth can only make that stop stricter. It therefore cannot execute the requested search at Kai's current health 36. Develop a general low-health emergency mode through the current-conversation handoff, reusing the existing search implementation rather than claiming reinvention. Current satiety is 5.3, energy 15.74824218 and owned inventory is empty; the previously eaten berry is not available again. No food or successful route is guaranteed.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Implement a general bounded emergency resource-search operation, parameterized by resource, origin, radius, maximum cumulative travel distance, maximum elapsed rounds, maximum energy expenditure, energy reserve, desired quantity, recheck flag, avoidance areas/directions and minimum health. Prefer an added mode on bounded-resource-search-recheck, preserving all existing modes and their rules unchanged. Record code dependencies on bounded-resource-search-recheck (forage:bounded-search-and-collection:recheck-emergency:1), bounded-resource-search (forage:bounded-search-and-collection:1), navigate (base:navigate:1; kernel.navigate; foundation-forest@1), probe and gather (base:gather:1). This new mode alone replaces the health<=60 stop with a validated minimum-health threshold: default 20, allowed range 20 to 100, stop at health<=threshold. It permits satiety<=8 but retains stops for injury in the preceding round, death, temperature<=12 or >=32, or stricter requested temperature bounds. This is bounded exposure to risk, not a promise of survival. Check current vitals and budgets before every step and after each completed step; do not execute a step that exceeds any budget or breaches the energy reserve. Require finite positive radius, distance, elapsed-time, energy and quantity limits supplied by the actor, rather than inventing a destination from unavailable position data. For food, require reserve>=1 and applicable personal evidence identifying the resource as edible; Kai's berry record, observedAt 152, supports nutrition 8 and toxicity 0 for berry, not hazelnuts or animals. Candidates are natural sources visible now or personally remembered within the bounds; exclude other people's sources, forbidden areas and unknown terrain not supported by observation. Prefer currently evidenced ripe candidates by nearest reachable distance, then optionally recheck sources last seen empty, at most once per source per run. Remembered stock is not current stock: navigate into interaction range, then use probe observe before gathering. Kai's commons-berry-3-0:observed-state (event-3-kai-21) and commons-berry-4-0:observed-state (event-15-kai-134) are historical destination evidence only. start-5-berries is observed empty; visiting it can yield an empty inspection, never assumed replenishment. With no candidate, permit only the existing bounded movement toward observed dry ground to reveal unseen portions; otherwise terminate with an explicit exhausted/no-feasible-step result. Run at most one ordinary navigate, probe or gather step per simulation round. No material or energy startup surcharge. Movement costs actual distance x2 energy, increased by ground and carried mass, with speed at most 0.8 distance per round; probe observe costs one round and 0.2 energy; gather costs one round and 2 energy per unit. Price each step using actual execution rules before commitment, including remaining energy and reserve. Gather only exposed ripe stock in reach, capped by verified current stock, remaining requested quantity, carrying constraints and affordable energy. Atomically debit source stock and credit exactly the collected units to inventory; create no food, healing or growth. Eating remains a separate eat (base:eat:1) action consuming an owned unit and 1 energy, applying real nutrition/toxicity without direct healing. Track run ID, exact source IDs, origin, route distance, elapsed rounds, spent energy, completed steps, inspections and collected quantity. Another action pauses the run; resume revalidates vitals, observations, stock, reach and all budgets. Elapsed simulation rounds include paused rounds; no hidden steps occur while paused. Cancel or death ends automation, releases any surviving unconsumed reservation once and preserves completed movements, observations and lawful inventory transfers under ordinary ownership/death rules. Consumed energy, time and depleted resources are not refunded. Review/development waiting advances no simulation time. No ongoing process after completion, cancellation or death and no maintenance cost. Implement validation, stopping, conservation and deduplication in code, not recurring model review. Other participants neither communicate nor act on Kai's behalf without their own actual actions.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Kai must study the implemented mode individually for one simulation round, with navigate, probe and gather prerequisites; no mastery is granted by this review. Requests, development, registration, study and automated search startup earn no pleasure or satisfaction. The minimal implementation adds no experience reward. Actual consumption uses established nutrition rules, never a mood-based reduction. Verified new observations, including informative empty-source findings, may be passed to an existing applicable experience mechanism only if it enforces personal relevance, functional deduplication, bounded event amounts and caps, decay and cooldown; repeated identical empty checks do not become reward farming. If no such mechanism is implemented, award zero. No protected reward account, budget, goal or permission is changed; physical comfort cannot exceed 10.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable start, step, inspection, collection, pause, resume and terminal events with run ID, actor, exact target ID where applicable, tick, position, action status and measured results. Supply reusable visual metadata for operation type, phase, target, progress, collected quantity and stop reason; reuse movement, probe and gather visuals rather than inventing a new successful-foraging animation. Show empty inspections as empty, unavailable paths as blocked and interrupted work as incomplete. Only a committed stock-to-inventory transfer may display collection success. Do not expose hidden source stock, imply ripe regrowth, display eating or healing without those actual effects, or mark learning complete before its study round completes.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

